    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d387">

                <pb facs="0606" n="504" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg504"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">504.418B1/206</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 862</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-08-22">August 22,
                        1935</date>.<lb/>[Received September 7.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your instruction No. 264 of
                    August 2, 1935, directing me to ascertain the attitude of the Spanish Government
                    toward the Roerich Pact, I have the honor to report that I consulted the Foreign
                    Office and was informed that when the Spanish Government had been officially
                    informed that this Convention had been signed and ratified by all the American
                    Republics it would adhere to it.<anchor n="6" xml:id="d387-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>For the Ambassador: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Walter</hi> H. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Schoellkopf</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Second Secretary of Embassy</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d387-f1" n="6" xml:id="d387-f1-content">
                <p>No further communication on this subject from the Spanish Government was reported
                    by the American Embassy.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
